        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1647 - Ahmad ibn Muhammad ibn Abi Nasr narrated from Abu al-Hasan Imam Ali ibn Musa Ar-Ridha (as):\nI asked him about what amount of a buried treasure (kanz) makes Khums obligatory.\nImam (as) replied: \"Whatever amount requires Zakat in its equivalent also requires Khums.\""
